    "[THIS PRODUCT] Made from organic Chinese green tea scented with natural jasmine blossoms.",
    "[THIS PRODUCT] Naturally contains caffeine.",
    "[GENERAL] Jasmine green tea is best brewed with water heated to 175°F–185°F (80°C–85°C), as fully boiling water can scorch the delicate green tea leaves and cause bitterness.",
